nt-size: medium; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">עשיר.......כלענה</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">מהיר.......כסיד</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">צח..........כזפת</span></div><div><br /></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">מבחן אמריקאי</span></span></h2><div><ol><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\">מה זה הִשְׂתָּרֵר?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\">כתב שטר</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\">קיבל צמרמורת</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\">גידל שיער</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\">השתלט</span></li></ol><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\">מה זה&nbsp;</span>תִּסָּפוּ?</li><ol><li>תקבלו תוספת</li><li>תמותו</li><li>תסתפרו</li><li>תעשו פוּ</li></ol><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\">מה זה&nbsp;</span>הֲשִׁכּוֹתִי?</li><ol><li>הרגעתי</li><li>סוככתי</li><li>השתייכתי</li><li>הגעתי למסקנה</li></ol><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\">מה זה&nbsp;</span>חֵלֶף?</li><ol><li>תצורה</li><li>תמורה</li><li>תנופה</li><li>תצוגה</li></ol></ol></div><div><br /></div></span></span></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מדרגאות</span></h2><h3 style=\"background-color: white; margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><p style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 תבואה<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מדון<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 תואר אצולה<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 שם אדם (מהפרשה)\n</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 שור בלשון התנ\"ך\n</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 דיבר\n</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 גבוה</span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; fon